Targets: # Low TitleId of games which are compatibles with this plugin (0 for all)

Title: Japanese OCR & Translation (HB)

Summary: Standalone Japanese OCR & Translation 3GX Plugin (Homebrew Build)

Description: |
  Real-time screen capture, OCR, and AI translation client for Nintendo 3DS homebrew.
  Features:
    - Direct hotkey activation (R + Start + Select)
    - In-game pause & inspection
    - Single word lookup & 2-point box selection
    - Encrypted communication with PC OCR server

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
